+// P139a (status.md; ORDER-73, the local agent on the GTX 1050: "the fort wall's stairs read too busy with the painted
+// relief", DEPTH-LOOK e): the candidate `?fortstairs=calm`, picked by the user 27.11 and ON by default since;
+// `?fortstairs=old` turns it off (then nothing here runs and stepMat returns the material it is given). The walls keep their painted relief and normal maps; a stair's treads and
+// risers get a calmer copy of the same texture — painted at FORTSTAIRS.k of the wall's weight (`?fscalm=`, default 0.3)
+// — and the wall normal map at FORTSTAIRS.n of its weight (`?fsnorm=`, default 0.35), its joints' shade at half. Every
